  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "card_b",
   "x": 100,
   "y": 692,
   "text": "\"a lot of people ask me if you open source your models how do you make money\"\nreason 1  \"it serves as a very good branding and marketing tool for us\"\nreason 2  \"if people try out our open source models and they really like it they\n           come to us for an upgrade to propriety models and they pay for the upgrade\"",
